# Events

One section per program; read the section of the program that owns your ticket. Every attachment of every program is below.

## HOS — applies when your ticket belongs to HOS

### Events

Events are explicit: constant in `pkg/common/events.go`, one subscription row per consumer app-id in `pkg/lib/events/subscriptions.go`, handler at `/events/<type>`, six-column row in the module's `HOSPACK/HOS/<MODULE>/spec/EVENTS.md`. The program catalog below is generated from those rows — it is the truth for who publishes and who consumes.

## HOS-UI — applies when your ticket belongs to HOS-UI

### Events

Events are explicit: constant in `pkg/common/events.go`, one subscription row per consumer app-id in `pkg/lib/events/subscriptions.go`, handler at `/events/<type>`, six-column row in the module's `HOSPACK/HOS-UI/<MODULE>/spec/EVENTS.md`. The program catalog below is generated from those rows — it is the truth for who publishes and who consumes. The platform topics (HOS) are in the second catalog; HOSPACK/HOS-UI only consumes them.

